{"schema":1,"pr":{"repo":"ToukoUrsin/junction26-kuitti","number":2,"title":"Invoice search, share link, notes and CSV export","url":"https://github.com/ToukoUrsin/junction26-kuitti/pull/2","author":"Crashtest author agent","authorIsAgent":true,"baseSha":"c9d4f4bd080e451ccd7292e28b2156dc7eb6c10f","headSha":"8b1f563384e52b3fec9a501da741798b6d57398d","additions":785,"deletions":88,"files":12,"issue":{"number":1,"title":"Invoice search, share link, notes and CSV export","url":"https://github.com/ToukoUrsin/junction26-kuitti/issues/1","body":"As someone who sends a lot of invoices, I want to find invoices quickly, share one with a client without making them sign up, keep a note on an invoice, and take my list into a spreadsheet, so I spend less time hunting through pages and answering \"can you send that again?\" emails.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n1. On the invoice list I can search by client name or invoice number. Search combines with the status filter, and both survive paging.\n2. Each row of the invoice list also shows how many line items the invoice has.\n3. An invoice has a free-text notes field. I can edit it; it shows on the invoice page.\n4. I can create a public share link for an invoice. Anyone with the link sees a read-only page of that invoice (client, line items, total, notes) without signing in. I can revoke the link, after which it shows \"not found\".\n5. I can export the invoices I am looking at (current search and filter) as a CSV file.\n6. Everything that worked before still works."}},"intro":"This change adds four things to invoices: search on the list page, a free-text notes field, a public share link that can be revoked, and a CSV export of the current list. Each list row also shows how many line items the invoice has. Two new database columns hold the notes and the share token, and older databases get them when they are opened.","stops":[{"id":"search-clause","title":"The search text is cleaned, then bound as a LIKE parameter","why":"The issue a